### Test Bus Company Registration (Should work without auth)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bus-company/registration/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Test Bus Company",
  "email": "test@buscompany.com",
  "phone": "0123456789",
  "address": "123 Test Street",
  "description": "Test bus company for API testing",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Test Get All Partner Bus Companies (Should work without auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/bus-companies

### Test Get Bus Company Detail (Should work without auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/bus-companies/1

### Test Registration Status Check (Should work without auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bus-company/registration/status?email=test@buscompany.com

### Test Public Schedules (Should work without auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules

